@startuml
!theme plain

title 基准测试系统架构

package "数据准备层" {
  [HumanEval 数据集] as HE
  [convert_humaneval.py] as CONV
  [需求文件\n(req_xxx.txt)] as REQ
  [官方测试用例\n(eval_xxx.json)] as TEST
  HE --> CONV : 下载+解析
  CONV --> REQ : 生成
  CONV --> TEST : 保存
}

package "测试执行层" {
  [run_humaneval_benchmark.py] as RUNNER
  [main.py\n(智能体)] as AGENT
  RUNNER --> AGENT : subprocess调用
  AGENT --> [代码生成] : LLM
  [代码生成] --> [solution.py] : 保存
}

package "验证层" {
  [evaluate_solution()] as EVAL
  [solution.py] --> EVAL : 读取
  [官方测试用例] --> EVAL : 加载
  EVAL --> [测试报告] : 通过/失败
}

RUNNER --> EVAL : 触发验证

note right of RUNNER
  对每个题目：
  1. 调用智能体
  2. 收集生成代码
  3. 官方测试验证
  4. 统计通过率
end note

@enduml